---
title: Order submission
---
flowchart LR
    accTitle: Order submission
    accDescr: A submitted cart is authorized by the payment provider. Authorized orders go to the warehouse; declined orders return to a retry queue that re-attempts once after five minutes before giving up.

    Cart([Customer cart]) -->|submits| Auth{Payment<br/>authorized?}
    Auth -->|yes| Pick[Warehouse pick list]
    Auth -->|no| Retry[(Retry queue)]
    Retry -->|once, after 5 min| Auth
    Retry -->|second failure| Dead[Abandoned order report]

    Stripe([Stripe API]):::external
    Auth -.->|charge| Stripe

    classDef focal    fill:#dbeaf5,stroke:#0072B2,stroke-width:2px,color:#062033
    classDef external fill:#ffffff,stroke:#767676,stroke-width:1px,stroke-dasharray:4 3,color:#3b414d
    classDef risk     fill:#fbe4dc,stroke:#D55E00,stroke-width:2px,color:#5a2000
    class Auth focal
    class Dead risk
